// Matériaux — source : enshrouded.wiki.gg + pindrop.gg (16/10/2026)
window.MATERIALS=[{"n":"Wood Acid","fr":"Acide de bois","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"This byproduct of the Charcoal Kiln has many useful porperties, which can be used in medicine and alchemy.","o":"Se fabrique au Four à charbon (10 acides en 7 min). Recette débloquée en fabriquant du charbon de bois la première fois.","oe":"You'll unlock the Wood Acid recipe once you craft Charcoal for the first time.\nCrafted in a Charcoal Kiln, this recipe produce 10 Wood Acids in 7 minutes."},{"n":"Wolfsbane","fr":"Aconit","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":33,"b":[],"d":"This plant is notable due to its stunning electrifying colorway, its delicate petals, and its deadly poison.","o":"Nécessaire pour la Flamme niveau 8.","oe":""},{"n":"Shroud Adhesive","fr":"Adhésif de Brume","ty":"Materials","ra":"Uncommon","lv":18,"b":[],"d":"A thick, viscius substance harvested from Shroud Flayers. Its tenacious bonding properties make it essential for crafting armor and securely sticking materials together in various crafting recipes.","o":"Lâché par les Écorcheurs de Brume (Shroud Flayers), dès les Plateaux nomades.","oe":"Dropped by Shroud Flayers, first found in the Nomad Highlands. Can be obtained from Shroud Flayer Seedling."},{"n":"Aquamarine","fr":"Aigue-marine","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"This aquamarine is as clear as a crystalline lake under bright blue skies.","o":"Filons d'aigue-marine dans le Bassin des eaux voilées (côtes, temples, sous l'eau).","oe":""},{"n":"Algae","fr":"Algues","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"","o":"Se récolte dans l'eau du Bassin des eaux voilées.","oe":""},{"n":"Aloe","fr":"Aloès","ty":"Material","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":["Nomad Highlands"],"d":"This desert plant contains a slimy liquid, which is known to have medical applications. Used in alchemy.","o":"Coupe les plants d'aloès dans les Plateaux nomades. Se cultive aussi avec des semis d'aloès.","oe":"Aloe is obtained by chopping down Aloe plants, found in the Nomad Highlands biome.\nAloe plants can also be grown from Aloe Seedlings."},{"n":"Ectoplasm Cluster","fr":"Amas d'ectoplasme","ty":"Materials","ra":"Epic","lv":33,"b":["Albaneve Summits"],"d":"A cluster of ectoplasm crystals. It holds immense magical powers inside.","o":"Sur les Creux des Salles creuses des Sommets de l'Albaneve.","oe":"They can be looted from Hollow in the Albaneve Summits Hollow Halls."},{"n":"Amber","fr":"Ambre","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":13,"b":["Revelwood"],"d":"Created through years of petrification, it has become a beautiful material used for production.","o":"À miner sur les filons d'ambre rouge dans la Brume des Bois envoûtés. Plusieurs gisements dans la grande cavité de Brume entre le Camp de chasseurs abandonné et le Tombeau caché, au nord de la Tour des Anciens des Bois envoûtés.","oe":"Mined from red amber veins in the Revelwood Shroud.\nSeveral deposits of amber can be found in the deep shroud cavity between Abandoned Hunter Camp and Hidden Hollow Tomb, north of Revelwood Ancient Spire."},{"n":"Amethyst","fr":"Améthyste","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":33,"b":["Albaneve Summits"],"d":"A beautiful mineral, usually found beneath the Shroud. Its color can range from a saturated royal purple to a light, lavender hue.","o":"Filons d'améthyste dans les Sommets de l'Albaneve (mines et grottes).","oe":""},{"n":"Antiseptic","fr":"Antiseptique","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Uncommon","lv":16,"b":["Nomad Highlands"],"d":"A medical solution that can clean wounds curing all active poison status effects.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Common Fishing Bait","fr":"Appât de pêche commun","ty":"Fishing Baits","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"Bait that increases the chance of catching common fish.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Uncommon Fishing Bait","fr":"Appât de pêche peu commun","ty":"Fishing Baits","ra":"Common","lv":13,"b":[],"d":"Bait that increases the chance of catching uncommon fish.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Rare Fishing Bait","fr":"Appât de pêche rare","ty":"Fishing Baits","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":[],"d":"Bait that increases the chance of catching rare fish.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Simple Fishing Bait","fr":"Appât de pêche simple","ty":"Fishing Baits","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"Very simple fishing bait made out of Critter Parts. Can be used to catch common fish, but not many will like the taste of that one.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Epic Fishing Bait","fr":"Appât de pêche épique","ty":"Fishing Baits","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":[],"d":"Bait that increases the chance of catching epic fish.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Fish Bones","fr":"Arêtes de poisson","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"Small fish bones that can be used in crafting. They feel brittle in your hands, but they'd be a terrible pain if stuck in your throat.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Gloomberry","fr":"Baies sombres","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Uncommon","lv":null,"b":["Revelwood"],"d":"A special berry that can only be harvested at night in the Revelwood. It can be used to enhance various dishes and to create deep blue pigments.","o":"Plante bleu vif qui pousse la nuit à Bois envoûtés.","oe":"Gloomberry is harvested from plants in the Revelwood at night. The plant grows a bright blue and is easily seen from afar."},{"n":"Purple Berries","fr":"Baies violettes","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Springlands"],"d":"Tasty and fresh berries, stimulating the bodily regeneration abilities with fresh vitamins for a short duration.","o":"Buissons de baies dans les Hautes pâtures (2 baies par buisson). Se cultive avec des semis.","oe":"Purple Berries is obtained from Purple Berry bushes, found in the Springlands biome.\nEach bush gives you x2 purple berries.\nBell Peppers can also be grown from Berry Bush Seedlings."},{"n":"Banana","fr":"Banane","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"","o":"Se récolte dans le Bassin des eaux voilées.","oe":""},{"n":"Steel Bars","fr":"Barres en acier","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":33,"b":["Albaneve Summits"],"d":"As an alloy of both iron and carbon, steel possesses better resistance and therefore provides more protection when used in armor.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Silver Bars","fr":"Barres d'argent","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":33,"b":[],"d":"Citizens of Embervale would sometimes invest in silver in the hope it would hold its value during a crisis. A crisis did come, but the silver offered little help.","o":"Se fabriquent à partir de minerai d'argent. Nécessaire pour la Flamme niveau 8.","oe":""},{"n":"Gold Bars","fr":"Lingots d'or","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":[],"d":"Solid gold bars that serve as both a crafting material and a status symbol.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Tin Bars","fr":"Barres d'étain","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":18,"b":[],"d":"A metal used to create bronze. It can be found in the Nomad Highlands.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Bronze Bars","fr":"Barres de bronze","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":18,"b":[],"d":"A beautiful material known for its warm and bright color. Artisans around the world have turned towards it for centuries, due to its workable characteristics.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Copper Bars","fr":"Barres de cuivre","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":13,"b":["Revelwood"],"d":"A rare and valuable metal thanks to its thermal conductivity. It's often used to create things that require a lot of heat.","o":"Se fabrique à la Fonderie (charbon de bois) ou au Haut fourneau (plus rapide, utilise du charbon). Recette débloquée en obtenant un Creuset (quête « Un creuset pour une fonderie »).","oe":"Copper Bars are crafted by the Smelter or by the Blast Furnace. The Blast Furnace smelts Copper Bars faster but requires Coal instead of Charcoal. The crafting recipe requires obtaining a Crucible during Crucible Needed For A Smelter to unlock.\nIt can also be picked up as a physical item in the world."},{"n":"Iron Bars","fr":"Barres de fer","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"A glistening silver metal that has a wide range of applications.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Alchemical Base","fr":"Base alchimique","ty":"Material","ra":"Common","lv":16,"b":[],"d":"A clear liquid with a sharp smell. Used to enhance alchemical reactions.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Shroud Slime","fr":"Substance visqueuse du Brume","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"Vibrant and deeply disturbing if you allow it to invade your mind.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Purified Slime","fr":"Substance visqueuse purifiée","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"A green glowing material that's been cleansed to rid it of its toxic characteristics.","o":"Se fabrique à la Presse à ectoplasme.","oe":"Purified Slime is created in the Ectoplasm Press."},{"n":"Toxic Slime","fr":"Substance visqueuse toxique","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"Mined from the deadly waste found in the Hollow Halls. Caution is advised!","o":"Mine les déchets verts mortels à l'intérieur des Salles creuses.","oe":"Toxic Slime can be obtained by mining the green deadly waste inside of Hollow Halls."},{"n":"Forest Beet","fr":"Betterave forestière","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Revelwood"],"d":"The edible root of a forest plant. Not all that sustaining on its own. Maybe good as an ingredient?","o":"Plants de betterave dans les Bois envoûtés. Se cultive avec des semis.","oe":"Forest Beet is obtained from Forest Beet plants, found in the Revelwood biome.\nForest Beets can also be grown from Beet Seedlings."},{"n":"Shroud Wood","fr":"Bois de Brume","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"The wood of Shroud infested trees. Its structure and properties are changed forever.","o":"Abats les arbres situés dans la Brume.","oe":"Shroud Wood can be gathered in the Shroud by chopping down trees found there."},{"n":"Hardwood","fr":"Bois dur","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":13,"b":["Revelwood"],"d":"This especially tough wood could cause much damage if it hits your head while you fell trees.","o":"Abats les grands arbres des Bois envoûtés.","oe":"Hardwood are obtained from chopping down large trees in the Revelwood biome."},{"n":"Tropical Wood","fr":"Bois tropical","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"This tropical wood can be harvested from ancient trees. It is very sturdy!","o":"Abats les grands arbres du Bassin des eaux voilées.","oe":"Tropical Wood is obtained from chopping down large trees in the Veilwater Basin biome."},{"n":"Wet Boot","fr":"Botte humide","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"A soaked boot, damaged through years of water exposure. Perhaps the fur on it could be useful.","o":"En pêchant, quand tu rates un poisson.","oe":"Can be obtained while fishing when you fail to reel in a fish."},{"n":"Shroud Sludge","fr":"Boue de Brume","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"Excessive experimentation proved that mixing slime and jelly creates sludge. All of these substances are entirely different and deserving of their own characterization due to their varied visconsity.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Algae Buds","fr":"Pousses d'algues","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"","o":"Se récolte dans l'eau du Bassin des eaux voilées.","oe":""},{"n":"Twigs","fr":"Brindilles","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":1,"b":[],"d":"A twig, as insignificant as it might seem, has a lot of potential. Everything starts somewhere...","o":"Partout : la plupart des arbustes et plantes en donnent, et en abattant des arbres.","oe":"Twigs can be readily sourced in any biome. Most shrubs and plants will provide twigs when harvested or chopped, and twigs will often drop alongside logs when chopping trees."},{"n":"Fired Brick","fr":"Brique cuite","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":13,"b":["Revelwood"],"d":"A shiny red brick that is crafted by hardening Lump of Clay under a heat even a Flameborn has issues with.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Raw Meat and Mushroom Skewer","fr":"Brochette de viande crue et de champignons","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"This mushroom skewer will strengthen not only your flesh but also your mind.\n\nGrilled over a fire, it will raise your maximum health, increase your magic damage, and accelerate your mana regeneration.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Raw Meat and Corncob Skewer","fr":"Brochette de viande crue et d'épis de maïs","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"A hearty feast that fortifies your body.\n\nGrilled over a fire, this skewer will increase your melee damage, boost your maximum health, and accelerate your health regeneration.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Raw Meat and Tomato Skewer","fr":"Brochette de viande crue et de tomates","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"A hunter's favorite ration, crafted for precision.\n\nAfter you've grilled it over a fire, it will grant you more maximum health, increase your ranged and dagger damage, and expand your maximum stamina.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Mist of a Fell Sicklescythe","fr":"Brume de Faucille des Déchus","ty":"Materials","ra":"Rare","lv":25,"b":[],"d":"A dense, swirling vapor extracted from Fell Sicklescythe. It is imbued with ethereal Shroud magic, making it invaluable for crafting magical armor and powering devastating spells.","o":"Lâchée par le des Déchus Sicklescythe (Regs exaltés). La quête t'emmène dans un Temple du soleil hanté où il y en a un.","oe":"Dropped by Fell Sicklescythe, first found in the Kindlewastes. The quest will take you to a Haunted Sun Temple, where one can be found."},{"n":"Bamboo Logs","fr":"Bûches de bambou","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":[],"d":"Sturdy, bendy, and regenerative: Bamboo is an ideal material for any Flameborn looking to build a tropical home.","o":"Coupe les bambous (Bassin des eaux voilées). Une meilleure hache coupe plus vite.","oe":"Bamboo Logs are obtained from chopping down Bamboo. Better Axes chop trees faster, along with the Mother's Eye to increase chopping strength."},{"n":"Wood Logs","fr":"Bûches","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Springlands"],"d":"","o":"Abats n'importe quel arbre avec une hache (partout, surtout Hautes pâtures et Bois envoûtés). Ressource de base pour presque tout.","oe":""},{"n":"Conifer Logs","fr":"Bûches de conifère","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":33,"b":["Albaneve Summits"],"d":"The raw and untreated wood of conifer trees. They fill the air with a fresh smell of pine needles and sweet resin.","o":"Abats les conifères des Sommets de l'Albaneve (plus l'arbre est gros, plus il donne). Donne aussi des brindilles et de la résine.","oe":"Conifer Logs are obtained from chopping down Conifer Trees, found in the Albaneve Summits biome. The amount obtained is determined by the tree's size, larger trees produce more logs. Along with the logs you can obtain Twigs and Resin.\nBetter Axes chop trees faster, along with the Mother's Eye to increase chopping strength."},{"n":"Palm Wood Logs","fr":"Bûches de palmier","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"Logs of a freshly cut palm, ready to be processed into an item of choosing.","o":"Abats les palmiers des Regs exaltés.","oe":"Palm Wood Logs are obtained from chopping down palm trees in the Kindlewastes biome."},{"n":"Ground Coffee Beans","fr":"Grains de café moulus","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"Ground coffee beans, ready to be brewed into an energizing cup of coffee!","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Roasted Coffee Beans","fr":"Grains de café torréfiés","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"A handful of roasted coffee beans. They smell chocolaty and rich, with a light note of floral sweetness. They must be ground up before brewing.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Limestone","fr":"Calcaire","ty":"Terrain Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Nomad Highlands"],"d":"The best stories start small, for example with this stone.","o":"À miner sur les falaises et rochers des Plateaux nomades.","oe":"Mined from cliffs and rock formations throughout the Nomad Highlands."},{"n":"Shell Limestone","fr":"Calcaire de coquille","ty":"Terrain Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"A type of limestone derived from seashells","o":"Dans le Bassin des eaux voilées.","oe":"Shell Limestone can be found in Veilwater Basin."},{"n":"Calla Luna","fr":"Calla Luna","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":18,"b":["Nomad Highlands"],"d":"A white plant with healing properties called \"Calla Luna\". To some, they represent purity and faithfulness while they're a symbol of sensuality to others.\nHowever, everybody can agree on their beauty and that their nightly green glow sets them apart from other blossoms in the Nomad Highlands.","o":"Plante vert vif qui pousse la nuit dans les Plateaux nomades ; visible de loin.","oe":"Calla Luna are harvested from plants in the Nomad Highlands at night. The plant grows a bright green and is easily seen from afar."},{"n":"Chamomile","fr":"Camomille","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":13,"b":["Revelwood"],"d":"A wondrous flower known for many potential applications, but used mostly for healing purposes.","o":"Plants de camomille dans les Bois envoûtés. Se cultive avec des semis.","oe":"Chamomile is obtained from Chamomile plants, found in the Revelwood biome.\nChamomile can also be grown from Chamomile Seedlings."},{"n":"Sugar Cane","fr":"Canne à sucre","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Nomad Highlands"],"d":"A sweet candy alternative made from plant fiber. The sugar rush is known to regenerate energy for a short amount of time.","o":"Plants de canne à sucre dans les Plateaux nomades. Se cultive avec des semis.","oe":"Sugar Cane is obtained from Sugar Cane plants, found in the Nomad Highlands biome.\nSugar Cane plants can also be grown from Sugar Cane Seedlings."},{"n":"Critter Carapace","fr":"Carapace de bestioles","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":33,"b":["Albaneve Summits","Veilwater Basin"],"d":"A carapace that protects the soft flesh underneath.","o":"Lâchée par les Bestioles des Déchus dans la Brume des Sommets de l'Albaneve et du Bassin des eaux voilées.","oe":"Critter Carapace is dropped by Fell Critters in Albaneve Summits or Veilwater Basin Shroud areas."},{"n":"Petrified Shroud Stalker Shell","fr":"Coquille de Pisteur de Brume pétrifiée","ty":"Materials","ra":"Uncommon","lv":18,"b":[],"d":"A dense, stone-like carapace torn from the Stalker, a ruthless assassin of the Shroud. Its near-unbreakable structure makes it a crucial material for forging tough and resilient armor.","o":"Lâchée par le Rôdeur de Brume (Shroud Stalker), dès les Plateaux nomades.","oe":"Dropped by the Shroud Stalker, first found in the Nomad Highlands."},{"n":"Scavenger Matron Helmet","fr":"Casque de Matrone des Maraudeur","ty":"Materials","ra":"Epic","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"She is less fearsome when headless. The acidic scent lingers, however.","o":"Sur la Matrone des Maraudeurs (boss des camps de Maraudeurs des Hautes pâtures). Nécessaire pour la Flamme niveau 3.","oe":""},{"n":"Mint Mushroom Meat","fr":"Viande de champignon à la menthe","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"","o":"Abats les pieds de champignons dans la Brume des Plateaux nomades. Nécessaire pour la Flamme niveau 5.","oe":"Mint Mushroom Meat is obtained from chopping down mushroom stalks in the Nomad Highlands Shroud. Just like trees, larger stalks will drop more mushrooms."},{"n":"Pink Mushroom Meat","fr":"Chair de champignon rose","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":[],"d":"A rose-colored piece of fresh mushroom meat. It has various applications","o":"Abats les pieds de champignons dans la Brume du Bassin des eaux voilées (8 à 12 sur les gros pieds).","oe":"Pink Mushroom Meats are obtained from chopping down mushroom stalks in the Veilwater Basin Shroud.\nJust like trees, larger stalks will drop more mushrooms.\nLarge stalks may drop as many as x8-12 Pink Mushroom Meats."},{"n":"Shroud Mushroom","fr":"Champignon de Brume","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":13,"b":[],"d":"A mushroom that is commonly found in the Shroud of the Revelwood biome.\n\nIt's inedible but can be processed into different materials in crafting.","o":"Abats les pieds de champignons dans la Brume des Bois envoûtés (8 à 12 sur les gros).","oe":"Shroud Mushrooms are obtained from chopping down mushroom stalks in the Revelwood Shroud.\nJust like trees, larger stalks will drop more mushrooms.\nLarge stalks may drop as many as x8-12 Shroud Mushrooms."},{"n":"Coal","fr":"Charbon","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":33,"b":["Albaneve Summits"],"d":"A hard lump of coal. It makes for great fuel!","o":"Mine le minerai de charbon à la pioche. Beaucoup à la colonie minière de Rothstep, au nord-ouest de la Tour des Anciens des Sommets de l'Albaneve.","oe":"Coal is obtained by mining Coal Ore with a pickaxe. Coal ore can be easily found in the Rothstep Mining Settlement, northwest of the Albaneve Summits Ancient Spire."},{"n":"Charcoal","fr":"Charbon de bois","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":["Springlands"],"d":"Created in a kiln under high temperatures.\nBurned wood mixed with oxygen creates a flammable material, highly convenient and needed to dive into the world of craftsmanship.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Wax","fr":"Cire","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":["Springlands"],"d":"A common ingredient with a smooth consistency. Needed for illumination of all sorts.","o":"Récolte les ruches sauvages sur certains arbres (près de Longkeep notamment), elles réapparaissent. Plus tard : Ruche fabriquée chez la Fermière. Nécessaire pour la Flamme niveau 3.","oe":"Wax can be harvested from beehives, found on some trees throughout the world. There are a few near Longkeep, by the first tutorial base. The player can harvest the beehive without destroying the tree. The naturally spawning beehives do respawn.\nLater in the game, after the Beehive Smoker has been found for the Farmer, the player can craft a Honey Beehive to craft Honey and Wax."},{"n":"Pumpkin","fr":"Citrouille","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":33,"b":[],"d":"Everyone unanimously agees that it is the spookiest vegetable of them all.","o":"Pousse dans certaines fermes des Sommets de l'Albaneve.","oe":"Pumpkins grows in some farms at Albaneve Summits."},{"n":"Pillbug","fr":"Cloporte","ty":"Fishing Baits","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":[],"d":"A little pillbug, also called a roly-poly. It can be found in the Albaneve Summits and used as fishing bait, especially popular among rare fish.","o":"Dans les Sommets de l'Albaneve, la nuit. Appât de pêche.","oe":"Can be found in the Albaneve Summits. Can be found at night."},{"n":"Nails","fr":"Clous","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"Nails made from Metal Scraps. Sharp objects that can be used as a tool or to improve a weapon.","o":"Dans les coffres et butins, ou fabriqués chez le Forgeron.","oe":"Nails can be obtained by collecting loot or by crafting at the Blacksmith."},{"n":"Ectoplasm Crystal","fr":"Cristal d'ectoplasme","ty":"Materials","ra":"Epic","lv":25,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"A sizeable ectoplasm crystal. Its properties allow it to store life force for eons.","o":"Sur les ennemis Creux des Salles creuses des Regs exaltés.","oe":"Ectoplasm Crystals can be obtained from defeating Hollow enemies in Kindlewastes Hollow Halls."},{"n":"Leather","fr":"Cuir","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":18,"b":["Nomad Highlands"],"d":"A versatile and durable material, that is smooth to the touch. It has also the advantage of being waterproof.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Reptile Leather","fr":"Cuir de reptile","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":13,"b":[],"d":"A sturdy material used in extravagant tailoring.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Water Reptile Leather","fr":"Cuir de reptile aquatique","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":[],"d":"A shiny material with an interesting texture. Any garment made with this will appear very fashionable.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Hardened Leather","fr":"Cuir renforcé","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":33,"b":[],"d":"This patch of leather has been made more sturdy and enduring.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Penny Bun","fr":"Cèpes","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Springlands"],"d":"A great snack that stimulates the brain.\nIncreases your intelligence by a small amount.","o":"Champignons cèpes dans les Hautes pâtures. Se cultive aussi. Nécessaire pour la Flamme niveau 2.","oe":"Penny Bun is obtained from Penny Bun mushrooms, found in the Springlands biome.\nPenny Bun can also be grown from Penny Bun Seedlings."},{"n":"Monstrous Ribs","fr":"Côtes monstrueuses","ty":"Materials","ra":"Epic","lv":18,"b":[],"d":"Large ribs of the most vile Fell Monster.","o":"Lâchées par la Monstruosité des Déchus, dès les Plateaux nomades.","oe":"Dropped by Fell Monstrosity, first found in the Nomad Highlands biome."},{"n":"Blackmire Heartwood","fr":"Cœur de bois de Blackmire","ty":"Terrain Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"This century-old wood is found beyond the bark of the giant Blackmire trees.","o":"Dans le marais de Blackmire (nord-ouest des Bois envoûtés).","oe":"==Usage=="},{"n":"Fell Heart","fr":"Cœur de Déchu","ty":"Materials","ra":"Uncommon","lv":25,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"The faded heart of a Fell Foe. Its potent essence is key in crafting resilient armor and powerful healing spells.","o":"Lâché par le des Déchus Sporehead, dès la Brume des Regs exaltés.","oe":"Dropped by the Fell Sporehead, first found in the Kindlewastes Shroud."},{"n":"Bursting Fell Heart","fr":"Cœur brisé de Déchu","ty":"Materials","ra":"Uncommon","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"It's oozing, unnaturally enlarged, and still beating whenever you dare to look away. This heart's potent essence is a key ingredient in crafting resilient armor.","o":"Lâché par le des Déchus Sporehead, dans la Brume du Bassin des eaux voilées.","oe":"Dropped by the Fell Sporehead, first found in the Veilwater Basin Shroud."},{"n":"Venom Stinger","fr":"Dard venimeux","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"A sharp, organic stinger. Don't get pricked, or you'll have venom rushing through your veins!","o":"Lâché par les Guêpes géantes roses du Bassin des eaux voilées.","oe":"Dropped by Pink Giant Wasp in Veilwater Basin"},{"n":"Drak Teeth","fr":"Dents de Drak","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":[],"d":"A collection of conical teeth. The Drak lose them aplenty throughout their lives and fill the more permanent holes with gold implants or rage.","o":"Butin courant sur les Drak (Bassin des eaux voilées).","oe":"Drak Teeth is also a common drop from Drak."},{"n":"Fish Teeth","fr":"Dents de poisson","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"The threatening teeth of a fish that is no threat anymore.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Corrupted Boar Tusk","fr":"Défense de Sanglier corrompue","ty":"Materials","ra":"Uncommon","lv":13,"b":["Revelwood"],"d":"A jagged tusk that's been tainted by the Shroud. Pulsing with faint traces of toxic energy.","o":"Lâchée par les Sangliers des Déchus dans la Brume des Bois envoûtés.","oe":"Corrupted Boar Tusk is dropped by Fell Boars, found in the Revelwood Shroud."},{"n":"Water","fr":"Eau","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"","o":"Plusieurs méthodes : pompe portable ou arrosoir dans les étangs et lacs ; puits (génèrent de l'eau passivement) ; tonneau d'eau sous la pluie ; distributeur d'eau (quasi infini).","oe":"Water can be obtained through a few different methods:\n* The Portable Water Pump and Watering Can collect water from ponds and lakes scattered throughout Embervale\n* Wells and Improved Wells passively generate a stockpile of water, which can be gathered by interacting with the well or by siphoning out with the portable pump or watering can\n* A Water Barrel will gradually fill with rainwater if left exposed in an area receiving rainfall, which can then be gathered or siphoned\n* A Water Dispenser or Natural Water Dispenser will generate effectively infinite quantities of water until it is submerged, switched off, or removed"},{"n":"Ectoplasm","fr":"Ectoplasme","ty":"Materials","ra":"Uncommon","lv":13,"b":["Revelwood"],"d":"A strange material extracted from ectoplasm fragments. It was filtered through cloth and coal but still smells odd.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Excellent Ectoplasm","fr":"Excellent ectoplasme","ty":"Materials","ra":"Uncommon","lv":25,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"A slimy broth made from crushed ectoplasm crystals. It's \"safe to consume\".","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Greater Ectoplasm","fr":"Grand ectoplasme","ty":"Materials","ra":"Uncommon","lv":18,"b":["Nomad Highlands"],"d":"This liquid was created by crushing ectoplasm shards and gathering the resulting goo. It's been filtered an is technically sterile.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Archaic Essence (13)","fr":"Essence archaïque (13)","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":13,"b":["Revelwood"],"d":"A radiant whirl of energy that is needed to insert gems into weaponry.\n\nWhile initially used by the Ancients, it was claimed by the Fell to fuel their brood until you freed it from its newly organic prison.","o":"Récolte les bulbes jaunes dans les Repaires de la Brume des Bois envoûtés. Aussi dans les tunnels de Shroud Gazer derrière certains générateurs de Déchus.","oe":"Archaic Essense can be found by harvesting the yellow bulbs found in Revelwood Shroud Lairs.\nBulbs may also be found in the Shroud Gazer tunnels found behind some Fell spawners."},{"n":"Archaic Essence (18)","fr":"Essence archaïque (18)","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":18,"b":["Nomad Highlands"],"d":"A radiant whirl of energy that is needed to insert gems into weaponry.\n\nWhile initially used by the Ancients, it was claimed by the Fell to fuel their brood until you freed it from its newly organic prison.","o":"Récolte les bulbes jaunes dans les Repaires de la Brume des Plateaux nomades. Aussi dans les tunnels de Shroud Gazer.","oe":"Archaic Essense can be found by harvesting the yellow bulbs found in Nomad Highlands Shroud Lairs.\nBulbs may also be found in the Shroud Gazer tunnels found behind some Fell spawners."},{"n":"Archaic Essence (25)","fr":"Essence archaïque (25)","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"A radiant whirl of energy that is needed to insert gems into weaponry.\n\nWhile initially used by the Ancients, it was claimed by the Fell to fuel their brood until you freed it from its newly organic prison.","o":"Récolte les bulbes jaunes dans les Repaires de la Brume des Regs exaltés. Aussi dans les tunnels de Shroud Gazer.","oe":"Archaic Essense can be found by harvesting the yellow bulbs found in Kindlewastes Shroud Lairs.\nBulbs may also be found in the Shroud Gazer tunnels found behind some Fell spawners."},{"n":"Archaic Essence (33)","fr":"Essence archaïque (33)","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":33,"b":["Albaneve Summits"],"d":"A radiant whirl of energy that is needed to insert gems into weaponry.\n\nWhile initially used by the Ancients, it was claimed by the Fell to fuel their brood until you freed it from its newly organic prison.","o":"Récolte les bulbes jaunes dans les Repaires de la Brume des Sommets de l'Albaneve. Aussi dans les tunnels de Shroud Gazer.","oe":"Archaic Essense can be found by harvesting the yellow bulbs found in Albaneve Summits Shroud Lairs.\nBulbs may also be found in the Shroud Gazer tunnels found behind some Fell spawners."},{"n":"Archaic Essence (40)","fr":"Essence archaïque (40)","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"A radiant whirl of energy that is needed to insert gems into weaponry.\n\nWhile initially used by the Ancients, it was claimed by the Fell to fuel their brood until you freed it from its newly organic prison.","o":"Récolte les bulbes jaunes dans les Repaires de la Brume du Bassin des eaux voilées. Aussi dans les tunnels de Shroud Gazer.","oe":"Archaic Essense can be found by harvesting the yellow bulbs found in Veilwater Basin Shroud Lairs.\nBulbs may also be found in the Shroud Gazer tunnels found behind some Fell spawners."},{"n":"Archaic Essence (5)","fr":"Essence archaïque (5)","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":["Springlands"],"d":"A radiant whirl of energy that is needed to insert gems into weaponry.\n\nWhile initially used by the Ancients, it was claimed by the Fell to fuel their brood until you freed it from its newly organic prison.","o":"Récolte les bulbes jaunes dans les Repaires de la Brume des Hautes pâtures. Aussi dans les tunnels de Shroud Gazer derrière certains générateurs de Déchus.","oe":"Archaic Essense can be found by harvesting the yellow bulbs found in Springlands Shroud Lairs.\nBulbs may also be found in the Shroud Gazer tunnels found behind some Fell spawners."},{"n":"Luminous Growth","fr":"Excroissance lumineuse","ty":"Terrain Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"It glows in the dark. A moody light source often found in or around caves.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Flour","fr":"Farine","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":18,"b":["Nomad Highlands"],"d":"Flour that can be created by grinding Wheat Grains to dust.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Bonemeal","fr":"Farine d'os","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":["Springlands"],"d":"Useful for alchemical and magical purposes.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Metal Scraps","fr":"Ferraille","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"Remains of metal, which was present to witness humanity's downfall. They might turn out to be useful.","o":"Butin courant des Maraudeurs ; aussi en détruisant des objets métalliques ou ramassé au sol. Les Maraudeurs autour de Rookmore sont une bonne source au début.","oe":"Metal Scraps are common drops from Scavengers. It can also be looted from destroyed metal objects or picked up as a physical item in the world.\nThe Scavengers around Rookmore are a good source in the early game."},{"n":"Palm Leaves","fr":"Feuilles de palmier","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"Vibrant palm leaves that offer ample shade in the blazing sun. They can be used as a crafting ingredient.","o":"Abats les palmiers du Bassin des eaux voilées, ou cultive des semis de Licuala.","oe":"Palm Leaves is obtained from chopping down palm trees in Veilwater Basin.\nCan be obtained from fully grown Licuala Seedling."},{"n":"Sage Leaves","fr":"Feuilles de sauge","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Nomad Highlands"],"d":"A bitter tasting herb that can be found in dry areas. It's said to have enlightening abilities.","o":"Plants de sauge dans les Plateaux nomades. Se cultive avec des semis.","oe":"Sage Leaves is obtained from Sage plants, found in the Nomad Highlands biome.\nSage plants can also be grown from Sage Seedlings."},{"n":"Plant Fiber","fr":"Fibre de plante","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":1,"b":[],"d":"Maybe they can be used as strings? They seem to be pretty robust.","o":"Récolte les buissons partout dans Valdebraise, ou ramasse-les au sol. Se cultive avec des semis d'arbuste.","oe":"Plant Fiber is gathered from bushes found throughout Embervale. It can also be picked up as a physical item in the world.\nBushes can also be grown from Shrub Seedlings."},{"n":"String","fr":"Ficelle","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"Used to bind things together, String is an extremely important item.","o":"Se fabrique à la main, au Rouet ou à la Machine à filer (avec des fibres de plante). Butin courant des araignées, ou ramassé au sol.","oe":"String is crafted by Manual Crafting, by the Spinning Wheel, or by the Spinning Machine. The crafting recipe requires obtaining Plant Fiber to unlock.\nString is also a common drop from Spiders. It can also be picked up as a physical item in the world."},{"n":"Aureolin Flower","fr":"Fleur d'auréoline","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Springlands"],"d":"A beautiful yellow flower with magical properties that blesses the user's spirit.","o":"Cueille les fleurs d'auréoline dans les Hautes pâtures. Se cultive avec des semis.","oe":"Aureolin Flower is obtained from Aureolin Flowers, found in the Springlands biome.\nAureolin Flowers can also be grown from Aureolin Flower Seedlings."},{"n":"Shadowbloom","fr":"Fleur d'ombre","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":[],"d":"The shadowbloom is one of the few plants resistant to the Kindlewastes heat. Their bright orange petals are only visible at night and are used to make vibrant colors.","o":"Pousse la nuit dans les Regs exaltés.","oe":"Can be found at night in the Kindlewastes biome."},{"n":"Kindlewastes Flower","fr":"Fleur du Regs exaltés","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"An ingredient used in crafting recipes.","o":"Fleurs des Regs exaltés. Se cultive avec des semis.","oe":"Kindlewastes Flower is harvested from Kindlewastes Flowers, found in the Kindlewastes biome.\nKindlewastes flowers can also be grown from Kindlewastes Flower Seedlings."},{"n":"Brittle Shroud Flakes","fr":"Flocons de Brume fragiles","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"If these brittle flakes are not handled carefully, they can fall apart and stick to everything, especially clothes.","o":"Abats les grands pieds de champignons dans la Brume des Regs exaltés. Plus le pied est gros, plus il en donne.","oe":"Brittle Shroud Flakes are obtained by chopping down mushroom stalks in the Kindlewastes Shroud. Just like trees, larger stalks will drop more mushrooms."},{"n":"Animal Fur","fr":"Fourrure","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"Warm in the winter, comfortable in the summer. A versatile resource that is very common and can be used for many things.","o":"Butin courant sur les animaux sauvages et les Vukah, ou ramassable au sol. Se fabrique aussi chez la Chasseresse (à partir de Écussons de fourrure).","oe":"Animal Fur is crafted by the Hunter. The crafting recipe requires obtaining Fur Patch to unlock.\nAnimal Fur is also a common drop from wildlife and Vukah. It can also be picked up as a physical item in the world."},{"n":"Dried Fur","fr":"Fourrure séchée","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":["Springlands"],"d":"After drying the Animal Fur on the Drying Rack, it becomes sturdier and more durable for a longer period of time.","o":"Se fabrique au Séchoir. On en trouve aussi souvent au sol dans les Regs exaltés.","oe":"Dried Fur is crafted at the Drying Rack.\nIt is also a common physical item in the Kindlewastes."},{"n":"Ectoplasm Fragment","fr":"Fragment d'ectoplasme","ty":"Materials","ra":"Uncommon","lv":8,"b":[],"d":"A small crystallized ectoplasm. It contains a tiny bit of life energy","o":"Sur les ennemis Creux des Salles creuses, ou en minant à la pioche les tas d'os verts luminescents dans les Salles creuses.","oe":"Ectoplasm Fragments can be obtained from defeating Hollow enemies in the Hollow Halls.\nEctoplasm Fragments can also be obtained from green glowing bone piles in the Hollow Halls using the Pickaxe."},{"n":"Red Marble Fragment","fr":"Fragment de marbre rouge","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"The simple fragment can be processed into a stunning Red Marble Block.","o":"Dans les Salles creuses.","oe":"Can be found in the Hollow Halls"},{"n":"Strawberry","fr":"Fraise","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Revelwood"],"d":"A delicious aggregate-accessory fruit, predominantly found in the Revelwood.","o":"Plants de fraises dans les Bois envoûtés. Se cultive avec des semis.","oe":"Strawberry is obtained from Strawberry plants, found in the Revelwood biome.\nStrawberry plants can also be grown from Strawberry Seedlings."},{"n":"Yucca Fruit","fr":"Fruit du yucca","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"","o":"Se récolte dans les Regs exaltés.","oe":""},{"n":"Aerated Banshee Gel","fr":"Gel de Banshee aéré","ty":"Materials","ra":"Uncommon","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"A lightweight, protective gel. Has properties of Fell magic.","o":"Lâché par les Banshees des Déchus, dès la Brume des Hautes pâtures.","oe":"Aerated Banshee Gel is dropped by Fell Banshees, first found in the Springlands Shroud."},{"n":"Ectoplasm Gem","fr":"Gemme d'ectoplasme","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":["Springlands"],"d":"A facetted gemstone made from refined frozen ectoplasm.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Gentian","fr":"Gentiane","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"A star-shaped blossom that blooms in the high-up mountains. It grants more spirit when consumed.","o":"Plantes des Sommets de l'Albaneve. Nécessaire pour la Flamme niveau 7.","oe":""},{"n":"Glimmer Gentian","fr":"Gentiane scintillante","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"\"Glimmer Gentian\" is a variant of the gentian plant that can only be found in the Albaneve Summits at night.\n\nIt emits a bright pink glow and can be used to create vibrant color palettes.","o":"Pousse la nuit dans les Sommets de l'Albaneve (violet vif, visible de loin).","oe":"Can be found in the Albaneve Summits at night, it grows a bright purple color and is easily seen from afar."},{"n":"Raw Game","fr":"Gibier cru","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"Uncooked game. Must be roasted over a fire.","o":"Sur les cerfs et animaux sauvages.","oe":""},{"n":"Ginger","fr":"Gingembre","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"","o":"Se récolte dans le Bassin des eaux voilées.","oe":""},{"n":"Chanterelle","fr":"Chanterelle","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Albaneve Summits"],"d":"","o":"Se récolte dans les Sommets de l'Albaneve.","oe":""},{"n":"Ice","fr":"Glace","ty":"Terrain Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"Crystalline, ice-cold, and slippery.","o":"À miner dans les Sommets de l'Albaneve. Nécessaire pour la Flamme niveau 7.","oe":""},{"n":"Enshrouded Ice","fr":"Glace embrumée","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":33,"b":["Albaneve Summits"],"d":"Frozen, enshrouded liquid that's cool to the touch.\n\nIt's unusable by itself, but can be processed into different materials in crafting.","o":"Fréquente dans la Brume des Sommets de l'Albaneve.","oe":"Commonly found in the Shroud of the Albaneve Summits biome."},{"n":"Ammonia Gland","fr":"Glande d'ammoniac","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":16,"b":["Nomad Highlands"],"d":"This gland contains a concentrated substance which can be used to tan furs.","o":"Lâchée par les Crabes-champignons des Déchus dans la Brume des Plateaux nomades et des Regs exaltés (notamment Umber Creux).","oe":"Ammonia Glands are dropped by Fell Mushroom Crabs in the Nomad Highlands and Kindlewastes Shroud (notably Umber Hollow)."},{"n":"Spider Gland","fr":"Glande d'araignée","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"A gland that's seemingly dripping with poison. Don't think about it too much, or the visual will haunt your dreams.\n\nFound on poison-spitting spiders and can be used in crafting to produce an antidote to Hemotoxin.","o":"Sur les araignées.","oe":"Can be looted from Spiders."},{"n":"Critter Glands","fr":"Glandes de bestioles","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":18,"b":["Nomad Highlands","Kindlewastes"],"d":"A pair of slippery Glands.","o":"Lâchées par les Bestioles des Déchus volantes dans la Brume des Plateaux nomades et des Regs exaltés.","oe":"Critter Glands is dropped by flying Fell Critters, found in the Nomad Highlands and Kindlewastes Shroud."},{"n":"Wisteria","fr":"Glycine","ty":"Overgrowth Material","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"Use the Overgrowth Tool to apply this to structures in your base.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Tar","fr":"Goudron","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"Not very pretty, but useful when it comes to creating protection from the elements.","o":"Trois façons : le fabriquer, un feu de camp consumé (1 goudron pour 2 bois) ou en brûlant de la nourriture (1 goudron).","oe":"There are three ways to obtain Tar: Crafting, a burnt out Campfire or burning Food.\nA burnt out campfire will yield 1 Tar per 2 Wood required to craft the Campfire, whilst crafting will yield 1 Tar per 1.5 Wood + 0.3 Dirt.\nBurning food will yield 1 Tar."},{"n":"Water Pouch","fr":"Poche à eau","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"This pouch can be filled at a well or lake. A sip of water helps recharge your power!","o":"Se fabrique à la main ; aussi dans les butins et sur les Maraudeurs.","oe":"Crafted via Manual Crafting, can be looted in the world and from Scavengers."},{"n":"Wheat Grains","fr":"Grains de blé","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":18,"b":["Nomad Highlands"],"d":"Both a cooking ingredient and a seed for the fields.","o":"Plants de blé à Bounty Barn ou Rattlebleak (Plateaux nomades). Se cultive avec des semis de blé.","oe":"Wheat Grains is obtained from Wheat plants, found at the Bounty Barn or Rattlebleak in the Nomad Highlands biome.\nEach plants yields Wheat Grains and x2 Straw.\nWheat plants can also be grown from Wheat Seedlings."},{"n":"Coffee Beans","fr":"Grains de café","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"These raw coffee beans must be roasted and ground before unfolding the depths of their flavor.","o":"Récolte les caféiers du Bassin des eaux voilées.","oe":""},{"n":"Granite","fr":"Granit","ty":"Terrain Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"A magmatic deep rock mostly consisting of feldspar, quartz, and mica.","o":"Partout sur les flancs de montagne des Sommets de l'Albaneve.","oe":"Granite is found all over the mountainside in Albaneve Summits."},{"n":"Grapple Plant","fr":"Plante-grappin","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"A resilient herb, growing in the harsh Kindlewastes climate. Spiritualists were known to use it for mystical purposes.","o":"Plants dans les Regs exaltés ; beaucoup à Rose Shell Burrow et Sunsimmer Souterrain. Se cultive aussi.","oe":"Grapple Plant is obtained from Grapple Plants, found in the Kindlewastes biome.\nLarge amounts can be found at Rose Shell Burrow and Sunsimmer Souterrain.\nGrapple Plant can also be grown from Grapple Plant Seedlings."},{"n":"Rubble","fr":"Gravats","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"The dusty remains of building materials.","o":"Mine les bâtiments en ruine à la pioche.","oe":"Obtained by mining with a pickaxe from ruined buildings.\nUsed in creating \"Roughly Cut Stone Block\""},{"n":"Frog","fr":"Grenouille","ty":"Fishing Baits","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":[],"d":"A tiny frog. He could be your best friend if you didn't need to use him as fishbait.\n\nFound in the Veilwater Basin and especially helpful to catch epic fish.","o":"Dans le Bassin des eaux voilées. Appât de pêche.","oe":"Can be found in the Veilwater Basin"},{"n":"Drak Claws","fr":"Griffes de Drak","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":[],"d":"Meant to hold and rip prey, these claws are still sharp as ever.","o":"Butin courant sur les Drak (Bassin des eaux voilées).","oe":"Drak Claws is also a common drop from Drak."},{"n":"Sandstone","fr":"Grès","ty":"Terrain Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"Sandstone are stones that consist mainly out of big sand particles - a beautiful natural material and another wonder of nature to admire.","o":"À miner sur les falaises et rochers des Regs exaltés.","oe":"Mined from cliffs and rock formations throughout the Kindlewastes."},{"n":"Goo","fr":"Pâte visqueuse","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":13,"b":["Revelwood"],"d":"A sticky paste used to bind chemical substances.","o":"Nécessaire pour la Flamme niveau 4.","oe":""},{"n":"Shroud Gelatin","fr":"Gélatine de Brume","ty":"Materials","ra":"Uncommon","lv":18,"b":[],"d":"A translucent, gelatinous substance extracted from Shroud Depthdwellers. It shimmers with an eerie glow and possesses restorative and protective properties. Essential for crafting healing spells and magical wards.","o":"Sur les Shroud Depthdwellers (créatures des profondeurs de la Brume).","oe":"Can be obtained from Shroud Depthdwellers."},{"n":"Enshrouded Oil","fr":"Huile embrumée","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"Its uses are unknown even to the creator itself, but it definitely didn't help the skin of the Fell!","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Daylily","fr":"Hémérocalle","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"A orange daylily flower. The petals are vibrant enough to be used for dyes.","o":"Plantes du Bassin des eaux voilées, ou semis d'hémérocalle.","oe":"Daylily are harvested from plants in the Veilwater Basin or Daylily Seedling."},{"n":"Indigo Plant","fr":"Plante indigo","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":13,"b":["Revelwood"],"d":"A plant known for its flowers and deep blue organic pigment that can be won by processing it.","o":"Plants d'indigo dans les Bois envoûtés. Se cultive avec des semis.","oe":"Indigo Plant is harvested from Indigo plants, found in the Revelwood biome.\nIndigo plants can also be grown from Indigo Seedlings."},{"n":"Repair Kit","fr":"Kit de réparation","ty":"Materials","ra":"Uncommon","lv":18,"b":[],"d":"Repair your equipment on the go. Gradually restores a small amount of durability over time.","o":"Se fabrique chez la Chasseresse.","oe":"Crafted at the Hunter."},{"n":"The Dragons' Map","fr":"La carte des dragons","ty":"Collectible","ra":"Collectible","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"A reconstructed map, consisting of 4 former map pieces. It depicts a lake with an island, a river, an obelisk, and parts of a large skeleton. The full writing on the back now reads:","o":"Se fabrique à la main (avec les morceaux de carte).","oe":"The Dragons' Map can be crafted with Manual Crafting."},{"n":"Wool","fr":"Laine","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":33,"b":[],"d":"Refined wool. It can be used for weaving garments and warm padding.","o":"Se fabrique à la Machine à filer à partir de laine brute (yacks). Nécessaire pour la Flamme niveau 7.","oe":""},{"n":"Raw Wool","fr":"Laine brute","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":33,"b":[],"d":"Raw wool. It's fluffy, easily knotted, and smells vaguely earthy. It needs to be processed further to be used for garments and armor.","o":"Parfois sur les yacks tués ; ou apprivoise des yacks : avec un abri, un lit et de la nourriture, ils te donnent de la laine.","oe":"Raw Wool can be obtained sometimes by killing Yaks or taming them, when provided shelter, a bed and food they will provide Raw Wool for you."},{"n":"Milk","fr":"Lait","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Springlands"],"d":"A delicious jug of milk. Drinking it will grant you endurance and recharge your stamina faster!","o":"Produit par les chèvres domestiquées (chèvres communes des Hautes pâtures).","oe":"Milk is collected from domesticated Common Goats, which are found in the Springlands."},{"n":"Uncooked Fae Deer Milk","fr":"Lait de Cerf Fae non cuit","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Revelwood"],"d":"Raw Fae Deer Milk. It has to be cooked to be consumed safely.","o":"Lâché par les Cerfs féeriques des Bois envoûtés ; aussi produit par les cerfs domestiqués.","oe":"Uncooked Fae Deer Milk is dropped by Fae Deer in the Revelwood. It is also collected from domesticated Fae Deer."},{"n":"Cooked Fae Deer Milk","fr":"Lait de Cerf Fae cuit","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Uncommon","lv":null,"b":["Revelwood"],"d":"A delicious jug of Fae Deer milk. Drinking it will grant you endurance and recharge your stamina faster!","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Frizzy Goat Milk","fr":"Lait de Chèvre frisée","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"A delicious jug of Frizzy Goat milk. Drinking it will grant you endurance.","o":"Produit par les chèvres frisées domestiquées (Sommets de l'Albaneve).","oe":""},{"n":"Lapislazuli","fr":"Lapis-lazuli","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":["Kindlewastes","Nomad Highlands"],"d":"A rare gem famous for its magical properties as a catalyst. It's great for channeling and shielding!","o":"Filons bleus le long des falaises des Plateaux nomades et des Regs exaltés.","oe":"Mined from blue veins along the cliffs of the Nomad Highlands and Kindlewastes."},{"n":"Ivy","fr":"Lierre","ty":"Overgrowth Material","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":["Nomad Highlands"],"d":"Use the Overgrowth Tool to apply this to structures in your base.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Flax","fr":"Lin","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":13,"b":["Revelwood"],"d":"A popular plant due to its strong fibers. It can be used to make linen.","o":"Plants de lin dans les Bois envoûtés. Se cultive avec des semis de lin.","oe":"Flax is obtained from Flax plants, found in the Revelwood biome.\nFlax can also be grown from Flax Seedlings."},{"n":"Linen","fr":"Lin","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":13,"b":["Revelwood"],"d":"The natural fiber won from the processing of Flax.","o":"Se fabrique au Fuseau (rapide mais gourmand en lin), au Rouet (lent, économe) ou à la Machine à filer (bon compromis).","oe":"Linen is crafted at either the Hand Spindle, the Spinning Wheel, or the Spinning Machine. \nThe Hand Spindle produces 6 Linen per minute, making it the fastest but most Flax-intensive. The Spinning Wheel is the slowest at 2 Linen per minute, but uses half as much Flax per Linen as the Hand Spindle. The Spinning Machine balances speed and efficiency, averaging 3.75 Linen per minute and using 50% less Flax per Linen than the Spinning Wheel, though it produces in batches."},{"n":"Shroud Liquid","fr":"Brume liquide","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"The liquified essence of the Shroud, harvested from enshrouded growths. The brown fluid emits a violet vapour and is used for many powerful alchemical purposes.","o":"Dans la Brume : ramasse les petits champignons au sol ou frappe les gros champignons avec un outil. Nécessaire pour la Flamme niveau 2.","oe":"Shroud Liquid can be found in the Shroud, looted from mushrooms on the ground and gathered using tools from larger mushrooms."},{"n":"Fire Fly","fr":"Luciole","ty":"Fishing Baits","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":["Springlands"],"d":"An animal, also blessed by the Flame, that spreads light in the dark.","o":"Se récolte la nuit dans les Hautes pâtures (lumière jaune visible de loin). Appât de pêche.","oe":"Fire Flies are harvested in the Springlands at night. They grow a bright yellow and are easily seen from afar."},{"n":"Midnight Lily","fr":"Lys de minuit","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Uncommon","lv":null,"b":["Springlands"],"d":"An edible flower used to enhance the effect of certain dishes. It only blooms at night in the Springlands.","o":"Plante bleu vif qui pousse la nuit dans les Hautes pâtures.","oe":"Midnight Lily is harvested from plants in the Springlands at night. The plant grows a bright blue and is easily seen from afar."},{"n":"Mauveine","fr":"Mauvéine","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":33,"b":[],"d":"Useful for flesh wounds.","o":"Se fabrique (teinture). Nécessaire pour la Flamme niveau 8.","oe":""},{"n":"Honey","fr":"Miel","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Springlands"],"d":"The following sugar rush recharges stamina!","o":"Récolte les ruches sauvages sur certains arbres (quelques-unes près de Longkeep, la première base). Elles réapparaissent. Plus tard : Ruche fabriquée chez la Fermière (après avoir trouvé l'Enfumoir).","oe":"Honey can be harvested from beehives, found on some trees throughout the world. There are a few near Longkeep, by the first tutorial base. The player can harvest the beehive without destroying the tree. The naturally spawning beehives do respawn.\nLater in the game, after the Beehive Smoker has been found for the Farmer, the player can craft a Honey Beehive to craft Honey and Wax.\n=== Crafting ==="},{"n":"Silver Ore","fr":"Minerai d'argent","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":33,"b":["Albaneve Summits"],"d":"Silver is a precious metal often found in combination with other minerals. This raw silver ore will need to be processed to become useful.","o":"Filons d'argent dans les Sommets de l'Albaneve.","oe":""},{"n":"Gold Ore","fr":"Minerai d'or","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"The most tantalizing gold ore is often hidden beneath the water's surface, but be careful when spotting a glint of golden light at the bottom of a stream. The gold rush may swallow you if the wave's don't","o":"Filons d'or dans le Bassin des eaux voilées. Nécessaire pour la Flamme niveau 9.","oe":""},{"n":"Tin Ore","fr":"Minerai d'étain","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":18,"b":["Nomad Highlands"],"d":"An ore which contains traces of tin. Needed to create Tin Bars.","o":"Filons d'étain dans les mines et grottes de la Brume des Plateaux nomades. Nécessaire pour la Flamme niveau 5.","oe":"Mined from Tin veins in mines and cave passages in the Nomad Highlands Shroud.\nThe Wiki's Map shows what veins each Mine and Cave Passage have, if any, when its icon is clicked on."},{"n":"Copper Ore","fr":"Minerai de cuivre","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":13,"b":["Revelwood"],"d":"A common ore needed to create Copper Bar","o":"Filons de minerai de cuivre, dès Bois envoûtés (grottes et mines).","oe":"Mined from Copper Ore veins, first found in the Revelwood."},{"n":"Iron Ore","fr":"Minerai de fer","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"The natural resource needed to create Iron Bars, an important material for every adventurer on the way to the top.","o":"Filons de fer dans les mines et passages de grottes de la Brume des Regs exaltés (par ex. la mine de Ridgeback).","oe":"Mined from Iron veins in mines and cave passages in the Kindlewastes Shroud.\nHere are some locations containing resource veins.\n• Cave Passage — 4\n• Cave Passage\n• Cave Passage\n• Cave Passage — 3 — Fell Critter and Exploding Fell Beetle\n• Cave Passage\n• Cave Passage\n• Cave Passage\n• Ridgeback Mine"},{"n":"Ony's Map Piece","fr":"Morceau de carte d'Ony","ty":"Collectible","ra":"Collectible","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"The fragment of a torn treasure map, found on a dragon skeleton in the Albaneve Summits. Perhaps you could reconstruct the map if you found all the pieces?","o":"Au camp de fouille du squelette « Ony », dans un nid au sommet du grand squelette.","oe":"Ony's Map Piece is found at Skeleton Excavation Camp \"Ony\". The piece is located in a nest on top of the large skeleton."},{"n":"Orpheus' Map Piece","fr":"Morceau de carte d'Orpheus","ty":"Collectible","ra":"Collectible","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"The fragment of a torn treasure map, found on a dragon skeleton in the Albaneve Summits. Perhaps you could reconstruct the map if you found all the pieces?","o":"Au squelette géant « Orpheus », dans un coffre au sol près de la tête.","oe":"Orpheus' Map Piece is found at Giant Skeleton \"Orpheus\". THe piece is located in a chest on the ground by the head of the skeleton."},{"n":"Mae's Map Piece","fr":"Morceau de carte de Mae","ty":"Collectible","ra":"Collectible","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"The fragment of a torn treasure map, found on a dragon skeleton in the Albaneve Summits. Perhaps you could reconstruct the map if you found all the pieces?","o":"Au camp de fouille du squelette « Mae ».","oe":"Mae's Map Piece is found at Skeleton Excavation Camp \"Mae\"."},{"n":"Polaris' Map Piece","fr":"Morceau de carte de Polaris","ty":"Collectible","ra":"Collectible","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"The fragment of a torn treasure map, found on a dragon skeleton in the Albaneve Summits. Perhaps you could reconstruct the map if you found all the pieces?","o":"Au squelette géant « Polaris », dans un coffre dans la gueule du squelette.","oe":"Polaris' Map Piece is found at Giant Skeleton \"Polaris\". The piece is located in a chest, in the mouth of the skeleton."},{"n":"Critter Parts","fr":"Morceaux de bestioles","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":["Springlands","Revelwood"],"d":"Remains of the pests that dwell below the Shroud.","o":"Butin courant sur les Bestioles des Déchus dans la Brume des Hautes pâtures et des Bois envoûtés.","oe":"Critter Parts is a common drop from the Fell Critters found in the Springlands and Revelwood Shroud."},{"n":"Moss","fr":"Mousse","ty":"Terrain Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"A lovely patch of green moss. It can be used for highly effective bandages.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Mycelium (Material)","fr":"Mycélium (Matériaux)","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"Mycelium of mushrooms that have been absorbing the magical properties of the Shroud. Could this be used for alchemical purposes?","o":"Dans la Brume, mine le sol pour obtenir du mycélium.","oe":"In the Shroud, mine ground to gain Mycelium."},{"n":"Mycelium (Overgrowth Material)","fr":"Mycélium (Matériel pour la végétation)","ty":"Overgrowth Material","ra":"Common","lv":18,"b":[],"d":"Use the Overgrowth Tool to apply this to structures in your base.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Acidic Mycelium","fr":"Mycélium acide","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":18,"b":["Nomad Highlands"],"d":"Acidic Mycelium mined in the Nomad Highlands.","o":"À miner sur les plaques de sol vert luminescent dans la Brume des Plateaux nomades.","oe":"Mined from glowing green patches of ground in the Nomad Highlands Shroud."},{"n":"Active Mycelium","fr":"Mycélium actif","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"The active mycelium of mushrooms absorbs the Shroud's magical properties. Could this be useful for alchemical properties?","o":"À miner sur les plaques de mycélium bleu luminescent, partout dans Valdebraise, surtout dans la Brume.","oe":"Mined from glowing blue mycelium patches, found throughout Embervale, primarily in the Shroud."},{"n":"Mother-Of-Pearl","fr":"Nacre","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"The natural iridescent material that pearls are made of, it can be found lining the inside of certain shells and valued for its luminous shimmer.","o":"Dans le Bassin des eaux voilées (coquillages, côtes, sous l'eau).","oe":""},{"n":"Snow","fr":"Neige","ty":"Terrain Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"Powdery, lily-white snow. The way it drowns out the sounds of chaos makes he world seem just a little more peaceful.","o":"Creuse la neige dans les Sommets de l'Albaneve.","oe":""},{"n":"Electric Nerve","fr":"Nerf électrique","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"An electrified strand of nerves. It's a sought-after magical ingredient needed in some spell recipes.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Shroud Nexus","fr":"Nœud de Brume","ty":"Materials","ra":"Epic","lv":18,"b":[],"d":"Highly concentrated Shroud energy, bundled in a pulsating core.","o":"Se fabrique chez l'Alchimiste ; lâché aussi par la Monstruosité des Déchus et le des Déchus Sicklescythe.","oe":"Crafted at the Alchemist. They also drop from the Fell Monstrosity and the Fell Sicklescythe."},{"n":"Nitrate","fr":"Nitrate","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":[],"d":"A dangerous alchemical substance used to produce explosives. Better watch out!","o":"Se fabrique au Laboratoire.","oe":"Nitrate is created in a Laboratory."},{"n":"Hazelnut","fr":"Noisette","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Revelwood"],"d":"A nice snack for the way. The strength it takes to crack its shell, it gives back upon consumption.","o":"Noisetiers des Bois envoûtés (plusieurs noisettes par buisson). Se cultive avec des semis.","oe":"Hazelnut is harvested from Hazelnut bushes, found in the Revelwood biome.\nEach bush yields multiple hazelnuts.\nHazelnut bushes can also be grown from Hazelnut Bush Seedlings."},{"n":"Coconut","fr":"Noix de coco","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"A fresh coconut, plucked directly from a palm tree. The water inside can be drunk as is or processed into milk.","o":"Coupe les cocotiers ou cultive des semis de cocotier.","oe":"Can be obtained from chopping Coconut Palm trees or harvested from fully grown Coconut Palm Seedlings."},{"n":"Shroud Core","fr":"Cœur de Brume","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"A stable form of energy. Burning it at the Flame Altar may protect against the Shroud.","o":"Lâché par les boss des Déchus qui gardent les Racines de Brume et les Puits de l'élixir. Se fabrique aussi chez l'Alchimiste. Sert à agrandir l'autel de la Flamme.","oe":"Dropped by Fell bosses, commonly found guarding Shroud Roots and Elixir Wells.\nCan also be crafted by the Alchemist."},{"n":"Obsidian","fr":"Obsidienne","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":33,"b":["Albaneve Summits"],"d":"Volcanic, pitch-black glass formed centuries ago. It leaves sharp edges when fractured, making it interesting for smithing and crafting.","o":"Filons d'obsidienne dans les Sommets de l'Albaneve. Nécessaire pour la Flamme niveau 8.","oe":"Mined from Obsidian veins, found in the Albaneve Summits."},{"n":"Wound Ointment","fr":"Pommade pour les plaies","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":33,"b":[],"d":"Useful for flesh wounds.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Stinging Nettle","fr":"Ortie","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Revelwood"],"d":"One has to be careful when harvesting this herb, but the reward is surely worth it.","o":"Plants d'ortie dans les Bois envoûtés. Se cultive avec des semis d'ortie.","oe":"Stinging Nettle is obtained from Stinging Nettle plants, found in the Revelwood biome.\nStinging Nettle can also be grown from Nettle Seedlings."},{"n":"Bones","fr":"Os","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"Possessing magical properties, bones of the dead are often used in alchemy.","o":"Butin courant sur les animaux et les Creux (squelettes). Se mine aussi sur les tas d'os (notamment dans et autour des Salles creuses) ou se ramasse au sol.","oe":"Bones is a common drop from wildlife and Hollow, found throughout Embervale. It can also be mined from bone piles, such as in and around Hollow Halls, or picked up as a physical item in the world."},{"n":"Giant Bones","fr":"Os géants","ty":"Materials","ra":"Uncommon","lv":13,"b":[],"d":"These bones are far larger than normal and are exceptionally sturdy.","o":"Sur les Cyclopes Creux (boss) des Salles creuses des Bois envoûtés, des Plateaux nomades et des Regs exaltés (4 à 8 os chacun).","oe":"Giant Bones are looted from Hollow Cyclops bosses found in the Revelwood Hollow Halls, Nomad Highlands Hollow Halls, and Kindlewastes Hollow Halls. Each Hollow Cyclops drops 4-8 bones."},{"n":"Fossilized Bone","fr":"Os fossilisé","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":18,"b":["Nomad Highlands","Kindlewastes"],"d":"Over the years, untouched by anyone, the bones of all kind of magical creatures have hardened and turned to stone. A rare material due to its limited availability and high magical capacity.","o":"À miner sur les ossements géants des Plateaux nomades et des Regs exaltés. Une cage thoracique géante facile d'accès se trouve à l'ouest de la Tour des Anciens des Plateaux nomades.","oe":"Mined from giant bones found in the Nomad Highlands and the Kindlewastes.\nAn easily accessible giant fossilized rib cage is located west of the Nomad Highlands Ancient Spire.\n===Blacksmith===\n*Transcendental Screen\n*Transcendental Screen\n*Rogue Helmet\n*Rogue Chestplate\n*Rogue Gloves\n===Alchemist===\n*Eternal Chain Heal\n*Eternal Ice Bolt\n*Warlock Boots\n*Archmage Chest\n*Archmage Gloves\n*Sage Tunic\n*Sage Gloves\n*Magician Chest\n*Herbalist Headwrap\n*Herbalist Tunic\n*Herbalist Gloves\n*Herbalist Pants\n===Farmer===\n*Fertilised Farm Soil\n===Carpenter===\n*Spinning Wheel\n===Hunter===\n*Fossilized Bone Arrow\n*Hunter Hood\n*Hunter Vest\n*Hand Spindle\n*Loom\n===Grinding Stones===\n*Fossilized Bone Dust\n===Seedbed===\n*Bell Pepper Seedling\n*Wheat Seedling\n*Azure Russula Seedling\n*Rooibos Seedling"},{"n":"Straw","fr":"Paille","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":18,"b":["Nomad Highlands"],"d":"A natural plant, remains of the agriculture left behind, that grows in the world. It offers protection from the elements when used as building material.","o":"Plants de blé à Bounty Barn ou Rattlebleak (Plateaux nomades) : chaque plant donne du blé et 2 pailles. Se cultive avec des semis de blé.","oe":"Straw is obtained from wheat plants, found at the Bounty Barn or Rattlebleak in the Nomad Highlands biome.\nEach plant yields Wheat Grains and x2 Straw.\nWheat plants can also be grown from Wheat Seedlings."},{"n":"Flat Bread","fr":"Pain plat","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Nomad Highlands"],"d":"A simple meal, granting a lasting Melee Damage boost upon consumption. It tastes better in combination with other things, though.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Paper","fr":"Papier","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":[],"d":"A traditional but mighty tool of communication. Used for the preservation of knowledge.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Moth","fr":"Papillon de nuit","ty":"Fishing Baits","ra":"Common","lv":13,"b":[],"d":"An inconspicuous moth ripped from its natural ecosystem to be used as an alchemic ingredient.\n\nCan only be found at night in the fields of the Revelwood.","o":"À Bois envoûtés la nuit. Appât de pêche.","oe":"Can be found in the Revelwood at night."},{"n":"Shroud Particles","fr":"Particules de Brume","ty":"Materials","ra":"Uncommon","lv":18,"b":[],"d":"Contains a higher Shroud concentration compared to spores.","o":"Lâchées par les Déchus ordinaires, dès les Plateaux nomades.","oe":"Dropped by common Fell, starting in the Nomad Highlands biome."},{"n":"Passionflower","fr":"Passiflore","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"Take a moment to appreciate this fascinating flower and its beautiful pink color.","o":"Plante rose qui pousse la nuit dans le Bassin des eaux voilées. Nécessaire pour la Flamme niveau 9.","oe":"Passionflower are harvested from plants in the Veilwater Basin at night. The plant grows pink and is easily seen from afar."},{"n":"Reptile Hide","fr":"Peau de reptile","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":13,"b":[],"d":"The tough and scaly skin of a reptile.","o":"Lâchée par les Snapjaws.","oe":"Reptile Hide is dropped from Snapjaws."},{"n":"Water Reptile Hide","fr":"Peau de reptile aquatique","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":[],"d":"This hide is sleek and water-resistant. It's commonly procured from reptiles that prefer wet or water-filled environments.","o":"Lâchée par les Reptiles aquatiques du Bassin des eaux voilées.","oe":"Water Reptile Hide is dropped from Water Reptiles in Veilwater Basin."},{"n":"Pearl","fr":"Perle","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"A gorgeous pearl. The magnetic pull of its lustrious shine is only enhanced by its rarity.","o":"Dans les palourdes sous l'eau (Bassin des eaux voilées) ; parfois sur les Drak. Nécessaire pour la Flamme niveau 9.","oe":"Draks have a low chance to drop. Otherwise they can be found underwater in clams."},{"n":"Stone","fr":"Pierre","ty":"Terrain Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"The best stories start small. For example with a stone.","o":"Ramasse les petites pierres au sol partout (même dans la Brume) ou mine les roches avec une pioche (Hautes pâtures, Bois envoûtés).","oe":"Stone is collected by picking up small stones on the ground throughout Embervale, including in the Shroud. Slightly larger stones can be mined with a Pickaxe.\nIt can also be mined from large rock formations in the Springlands and Revelwood."},{"n":"Flintstone","fr":"Pierre de silex","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":["Springlands"],"d":"A soft small rock that became famous for its ability to release sparks. It has been associated with the Flame ever since","o":"Filons de silex, très courants dans les Hautes pâtures.","oe":"Mined from Flintstone veins, found commonly in the Springlands."},{"n":"Gold Coins","fr":"Pièces d'or","ty":"Terrain Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"Gold coins, ideal for bedazzling, boasting, and bribing.","o":"Dans le Bassin des eaux voilées. Le Charpentier t'envoie les chercher en quête, mais tu peux en ramasser avant.","oe":"Gold Coins can be found in the Veilwater Basin, the Carpenter sends you on the quest however, you can collect Gold Coins prior to that out in the world."},{"n":"Wood Planks","fr":"Planches de bois","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":13,"b":[],"d":"Planks created by cutting Wood Logs into shape. Very useful for building.","o":"","oe":"== Crafting =="},{"n":"Plantain","fr":"Plantain","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"","o":"Se récolte dans le Bassin des eaux voilées.","oe":""},{"n":"Metal Sheets","fr":"Feuilles de métal","ty":"Material","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"Sheets melted out of Metal Scraps to make them more workable and open up options for further processing.","o":"Se fabriquent à la Forge (construite via le Forgeron).","oe":"Metal Sheets can be crafted at the Forge, which can be created at the Blacksmith."},{"n":"Feather","fr":"Plume","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":18,"b":["Nomad Highlands"],"d":"A feather of a bird or creatures of some kind. Weighing next to nothing, it has to be useful for something.","o":"Lâchée par plusieurs créatures dès les Plateaux nomades. Aussi produite par les Becs-ronds domestiqués (Regs exaltés).","oe":"Feather is dropped by several creatures starting in the Nomad Highlands. It is also collected from domesticated Round-Billed Sailer, found in the Kindlewastes."},{"n":"Capybara Bristles","fr":"Poils de capybara","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":[],"d":"These capybara bristles can be woven into your clothing to help you glide through the water more easily and prevent you from cooling down too quickly.","o":"Sur les capybaras (Bassin des eaux voilées), en les tuant ou en les élevant dans ta base.","oe":"Can be obtained by killing Capybara or harvested from Capybara in your base."},{"n":"Bell Pepper","fr":"Poivron","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Nomad Highlands"],"d":"A plant of sweet flavor and powerful red color. Grants the user dexterity upon consumption.","o":"Plants de poivron dans les Plateaux nomades. Se cultive avec des semis de poivron.","oe":"Bell Pepper is obtained from Bell Pepper plants, found in the Nomad Highlands biome.\nBell Peppers can also be grown from Bell Pepper Seedlings."},{"n":"Silver Dust","fr":"Poudre d'argent","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":33,"b":[],"d":"Fine, shimmery silver powder. Don't drop it, or you'll find specs of silver in your floorboards for weeks to come.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Piscine Ivory Dust","fr":"Poudre d'ivoire piscicole","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"Piscine Ivory, often called the ivory of the sea, ground into a bright powder. Renowned for its strength and resilience, it can even serve as a component in metal alloys, lending them exceptional robustness.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Obsidian Dust","fr":"Poudre d'obsidienne","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":33,"b":[],"d":"Finely ground obsidian powder. It can more easily be alchemized in this form.","o":"","oe":"== Crafting =="},{"n":"Gold Dust","fr":"Poussière d'or","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"Gold ground to powder. It sparkles even more beautifully than before.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Fossilized Bone Dust","fr":"Poussière d'os fossilisé","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":18,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"Grinding the Fossilized Bone into dust frees its inherent magical attributes and makes it more handy for further production steps.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Coal Powder","fr":"Poudre de charbon","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":["Springlands"],"d":"Ground up coals, creating a highly flammable powder.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Chitin Powder","fr":"Poudre de chitine","ty":"Materials","ra":"Uncommon","lv":33,"b":["Albaneve Summits"],"d":"Fine powder made from grinding critter carapaces.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Iron Dust","fr":"Poussière de fer","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"Fine iron dust, used for different crafting purposes.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Gleam Root Dust","fr":"Poudre de racine brillante","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"This powder was derived from the Gleam Root plant, which only grows at night in the Veilwater Basin.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Green Vitriol Dust","fr":"Poudre de vitriol vert","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":[],"d":"The end product of chemical experiments, the crystals sparkle like shimmering sea foam.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Glow Dust","fr":"Poussière luminescente","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":13,"b":["Springlands"],"d":"A magical dust that can glow in the dark, consisting of the crushed remains of a Fire Fly.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Black Powder","fr":"Poudre noire","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"A dangerous alchemical substance used to produce explosives. Better watch out!","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Aquamarine Dust","fr":"Poussière aigue-marine","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"Finely ground Aquamarine crystals that sparkle beautifully.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Bug Dust","fr":"Poussière d'insectes","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":13,"b":["Springlands"],"d":"A protein rich ingredient created from crushed critter shells.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Shortcrust Pastry Base","fr":"Fond de pâte brisée","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"Perfectly crisp and buttery- a golden foundation for your sweetest baking experiments.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Flammable Goo","fr":"Pâte inflammable","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":33,"b":["Albaneve Summits"],"d":"A sticky and highly flammable substance. Handle with care!","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Brittle Shroud Petals","fr":"Pétales de Brume fragiles","ty":"Materials","ra":"Uncommon","lv":13,"b":["Revelwood"],"d":"Delicate petals tainted by the Shroud. Their surface is coated in a faint, toxic residue. Though fragile on their own, they are surprisingly resilient when woven into armor.","o":"Lâchés par les Lianes vicieuses des Déchus, dès la Brume des Bois envoûtés.","oe":"Brittle Shroud Petals are dropped by Fell Vicious Vines, first found in the Revelwood Shroud."},{"n":"Gleam Root","fr":"Racine brillante","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"An underwater plant that only grows where the moonlight coats the seafloor. It has an enticing glow that spells demise for any diver willing to forget themselves in their pursuit of the light in the deep.","o":"Plante bleue qui pousse sous l'eau la nuit dans le Bassin des eaux voilées.","oe":"Gleam Root are harvested from plants in the Veilwater Basin at night underwater. The plant grows blue and is easily seen from afar."},{"n":"Shroud Radiance","fr":"Éclat du shroud","ty":"Materials","ra":"Epic","lv":40,"b":[],"d":"The Highest concentration of shroud energy, even higher than shroud nexus","o":"Se fabrique chez l'Alchimiste.","oe":"Crafted at the Alchemist."},{"n":"Shroud Relic","fr":"Relique du Shroud","ty":"Materials","ra":"Uncommon","lv":40,"b":[],"d":"Contains a higher Shroud concentration compared to Shroud Particles.","o":"Lâchée par les Déchus ordinaires, dès le Bassin des eaux voilées.","oe":"Dropped by common Fell, starting in the Veilwater Basin biome."},{"n":"Padding","fr":"Rembourrage","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"A basic ingredient for all advanced armor. The padding added below the hard shell can create comfort and soften impacts. A Loom is needed to craft both padding and advanced armor.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Warm Padding","fr":"Rembourrage chaud","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":33,"b":[],"d":"A warmer and better-insulated padding kit. When used to create armor, it will protect you from the bitter cold.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Raw Rice","fr":"Riz cru","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"","o":"Se récolte dans le Bassin des eaux voilées.","oe":""},{"n":"Rooibos","fr":"Rooibos","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":18,"b":["Nomad Highlands"],"d":"An interesting plant, stimulating every persons taste buds. The use in tea has established itself as a custom.","o":"Buissons de rooibos dans les Plateaux nomades. Se cultive avec des semis.","oe":"Rooibos is obtained from Rooibos bushes, found in the Nomad Highlands biome.\nRooibos bushes can also be grown from Rooibos Seedlings."},{"n":"Climbing Rose","fr":"Rose d'escalade","ty":"Overgrowth Material","ra":"Common","lv":13,"b":["Nomad Highlands"],"d":"Use the Overgrowth Tool to apply this to structures in your base.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Paper Reed","fr":"Roseau à papier","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":1,"b":[],"d":"These paper reed fibers can be used in many crafting recipes just like other plant fibers.","o":"Roseaux au bord de l'eau ou dans les forêts de bambous.","oe":"Paper Reed is gathered from reeds near water, or in bamboo forests."},{"n":"Runes","fr":"Runes","ty":"Materials","ra":"Rare","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"Runes attract and store magical energy from all around them. Used to enhance weapons.","o":"Sur les ennemis des Déchus, dans les coffres, ou en démontant des armes. Servent à améliorer les armes et à réinitialiser les compétences (1 rune par point).","oe":"Runes can be obtained from defeating Fell enemies, looting chests, or dismantling weapons."},{"n":"Legendary Runes","fr":"Runes légendaires","ty":"Materials","ra":"Legendary","lv":13,"b":[],"d":"Legendary runes are imbued with an immense amount of magical energy. These rare and powerful artifacts are used to ```enhance``` legendary weapons, unlocking their full potential.","o":"Sur les ennemis puissants ; se fabriquent aussi chez le Forgeron.","oe":"Can be obtained by defeating powerful enemies, can also be crafted at the Blacksmith"},{"n":"Resin","fr":"Résine","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"This protective juice of trees has many functions. First and foremost, serving the cause of the trees!","o":"En abattant des arbres. Plus rapide avec les arbres à feuilles rouges et les semis d'arbre rouge des Bois envoûtés. Nécessaire pour la Flamme niveau 2.","oe":"Resin can be obtained through chopping down trees.\nIt can be more quickly obtained by chopping trees with red leaves and grown Revelwood Red Leaf Seedlings."},{"n":"Sand","fr":"Sable","ty":"Terrain Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"Sand, glittering like gold on a hot summers day, is shifty even in the best of hours.","o":"À miner au sol dans les Regs exaltés.","oe":"Mined from the the ground in the Kindlewastes."},{"n":"Shroud Sand","fr":"Sable de Brume","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"Fine sand that's been infused with Shroud spores.","o":"À miner sur les plaques de sable jaune luminescent dans la Brume des Regs exaltés.","oe":"Mined from glowing yellow patches of sand in the Kindlewastes Shroud."},{"n":"Veilwater Basin Sand","fr":"Sable du Bassin des eaux voilées","ty":"Terrain Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"A bright, silvery white sand that mostly consists of crushed seashells.","o":"Creuse le sable du Bassin des eaux voilées.","oe":"Veilwater Basin Sand can be found in Veilwater Basin."},{"n":"Fine Sand","fr":"Sable fin","ty":"Terrain Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"A mix of soil, rock and sediment.","o":"À miner au sol dans les Regs exaltés.","oe":"Mined from the the ground in the Kindlewastes."},{"n":"Shroud Sack","fr":"Sac de Brume","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":13,"b":[],"d":"An organic bag containing highly concentrated Shroud spores.","o":"Lâché par les Sangliers des Déchus et les Plantes cracheuses des Déchus (Bois envoûtés).","oe":""},{"n":"Cursed Shroud Sack","fr":"Sac de Brume maudit","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":13,"b":[],"d":"A dangerous, rotting substance, made half-liquid by its state of decay.","o":"Sur les Lianes vicieuses des Déchus du Bassin des eaux voilées.","oe":"Can be obtained from Fell Vicious Vine in the Veilwater Basin"},{"n":"Toxic Sack","fr":"Sac toxique","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":[],"d":"A large gland filled with lethal substance. Handle it with care.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Poison Sack","fr":"Sac à poisons","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Saffron","fr":"Safran","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"A rare herbal plant that can be found in hot areas of the world.","o":"Plants de safran dans les Regs exaltés ; beaucoup à Sunsimmer Souterrain et Rose Shell Burrow. Se cultive aussi. Nécessaire pour la Flamme niveau 6.","oe":"Saffron is obtained from Saffron plants, found in the Kindlewastes biome. Large amounts can be found at Sunsimmer Souterrain and Rose Shell Burrow.\nSaffron plants can also be grown from Saffron Seedlings."},{"n":"Corrosive Blood","fr":"Sang corrosif","ty":"Materials","ra":"Uncommon","lv":18,"b":["Nomad Highlands"],"d":"A volatile, acidic fluid harvested from weak Fell Foes. Its corrosive properties make it a valuable ingredient in crafting repair kits, where its unique chemistry is harnessed to restore the durability of worn-out items.","o":"Lâché par les ennemis des Déchus, dès la Brume des Plateaux nomades.","oe":"Corrosive Blood is dropped by Fell ennemies, first found in the Nomad Highlands Shroud."},{"n":"Drak Blood","fr":"Sang de Drak","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":[],"d":"Violet blood. It runs cold, and the consistency is somewhat syrupy.","o":"Butin courant sur les Drak (hommes-lézards du Bassin des eaux voilées).","oe":"Drak Blood is also a common drop from Drak."},{"n":"Grasshopper","fr":"Sauterelle","ty":"Fishing Baits","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":[],"d":"A resilient grasshopper that's adapted to the warm colors of the Nomad Highlands. It can be used as fishing bait, most likely to catch uncommon fish.","o":"Dans les Plateaux nomades, la nuit. Appât de pêche.","oe":"Can be found in the Nomad Highlands. Can be found at night."},{"n":"Scarab","fr":"Scarabée","ty":"Fishing Baits","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":[],"d":"A golden jewel scarab beetle. It can be found in the Kindlewastes, and is used as fishing bait, especially useful to catch rare fish.","o":"Dans les Regs exaltés, surtout la nuit, sur les zones herbeuses rocheuses. Appât de pêche.","oe":"Can be found in the Kindlewastes, mostly night (includes dusk), on rocky patches of grass and rocky flat areas."},{"n":"Salt","fr":"Sel","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":["Springlands"],"d":"Crystalline powder which can be found in enshrouded valleys. The taste of food can be improved drastically when sprinkled with salt.","o":"Gisements de sel dans les Hautes pâtures, par ex. les Mines de sel d'Egerton ou la Carrière saline. La première quête de la Chasseresse t'y emmène.","oe":"Salt is mined from salt deposits in the Springlands, such as Egerton Salt Mines or Saline Quarry.\nThe objective of the first quest given by the Hunter - - shows you the location of a large salt deposit at Egerton Salt Mines and requires you to collect salt there."},{"n":"Enshrouded Vulture Talon","fr":"Talon de vautour embrumé","ty":"Materials","ra":"Rare","lv":25,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"A massive, razor-sharp talon.","o":"Lâchée par le Vautour draconien des Déchus, dès les Regs exaltés.","oe":"Dropped by Fell Draconian Vulture, first found in the Kindlewastes biome."},{"n":"Shiitake Mushroom","fr":"Champignon Shiitaké","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"","o":"Se récolte dans le Bassin des eaux voilées.","oe":""},{"n":"Sulfur","fr":"Soufre","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"An important material and one of the basic chemical ingredients found within nature.","o":"À miner sur les dépôts de soufre jaune dans les Regs exaltés.","oe":"Sulfur is mined from yellow sulfur deposits in the Kindlewastes.\n• ! Items Produced !! Workshop !! Other Requirements !! Crafting Time !! Materials\n• 5 Enshrouded Oil — Laboratory — None — 2:00 — * 5 Shroud Spores\n* 5 Coal Powder\n* 5 Shroud Liquid\n* 1 Sulfur\n• 1 Black Powder — Laboratory — None — 3:00 — * 7 Nitrate\n* 1 Sulfur\n* 2 Coal Powder\n• 1 Shroud Meteor — Alchemist — Laboratory — N/A — * 2 Alchemical Base\n* 20 Nitrate\n* 20 Coal Powder\n* 20 Stone\n* 20 Sulfur\n• 1 Eternal Light Burst — Alchemist — Laboratory — N/A — * 5 Iron Bars\n* 10 Charcoal\n* 30 Sulfur\n* 20 Flintstone\n• 1 Eternal Acid Bite — Alchemist — Laboratory — N/A — * 20 Glass\n* 10 Charcoal\n* 30 Sulfur\n* 20 Ammonia Gland\n* 20 Poison Sack\n===Alchemist===\n*Mortar\n===Carpenter===\n*Ghost Glider\n*Wolf's Choir\n*Boar at Home\n*Flower Vase\n*Tower In The Night\n*Scabird On One Leg\n*Flower Snake\n*Temple Landscape\n*Still Life\n===Hunter===\n*Poisoned Iron Arrow\n*Red Fabric\n*Carpet"},{"n":"Fresh Shroud Spore","fr":"Spore de Brume frais","ty":"Materials","ra":"Uncommon","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"Fresh Shroud spores, used to craft medicines that can cure the Shroud curse.","o":"Sur les champignons bleus luminescents entourés de Déchus, la nuit, partout dans Valdebraise.","oe":"Collected from glowing blue mushrooms surrounded by groups of Fell, found at night throughout Embervale."},{"n":"Shroud Spores","fr":"Spores de Brume","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"Shroud Spores are particles of energy that create and give the shroud its corrupting power.","o":"Sur les créatures faibles de la Brume (Déchus).","oe":"Shroud Spores are found by looting weaker Shroud creatures."},{"n":"Stapelia Starflower","fr":"Stapelia grandiflora","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":33,"b":[],"d":"A flower with star-shaped petals. It fills the moonlit valleys of the Albaneve Summits with the smell of death.\n\nIts deep, dark color can be used to make pitch-black pigments.","o":"Pousse la nuit dans les Sommets de l'Albaneve.","oe":"Found at night in the Albaneve Summits biome."},{"n":"White Glowing Substance","fr":"Substance lumineuse blanche","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"This material glows in a warm white light. It's an alchemical miracle!","o":"Se fabrique chez l'Alchimiste.","oe":"White Glowing Substance can be crafted at the Alchemist"},{"n":"Sugar","fr":"Sucre","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Uncommon","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"The sugar rush powers your stamina regeneration for a short amount of time.","o":"","oe":"== Crafting =="},{"n":"Raw Taro","fr":"Taro cru","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"","o":"Se récolte dans le Bassin des eaux voilées.","oe":""},{"n":"Lump of Clay","fr":"Tas d'argile","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":13,"b":["Revelwood"],"d":"A malleable material that is especially useful for construction purposes.","o":"À miner sur les dépôts d'argile (gros amas de boue orange-brun), courants à Bois envoûtés.","oe":"Lumps of Clay can be mined from clay deposits, commonly found in the Revelwood. Clay deposits look like large clumps of orange-brown mud."},{"n":"Farm Soil","fr":"Terre agricole","ty":"Terrain Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"Healthy soil that will increase the growing speed of most plants.","o":"Se fabrique chez la Fermière (une fois sauvé pendant « Grandir ensemble »). Se mine aussi dans les fermes du monde.","oe":"The recipe is unlocked by retrieving the Farmer during Growing Stronger Together. It is then crafted at the Farmer. \nFarm Soil can also be mined at various locations in the world, particularly Farms."},{"n":"Fertilised Farm Soil","fr":"Terre agricole fertilisée","ty":"Terrain Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"Healthy, fertilized soil that greatly increases the growing speed of plants.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Shroud Infused Farm Soil","fr":"Terre agricole infusée de Brume","ty":"Terrain Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"Shroud infused soil seems dangerous at first glance. However, when used in a controlled environment, it can create a potent bioactive environment that encourages rapid growth.","o":"Se fabrique chez la Fermière.","oe":"Crafted at the Farmer."},{"n":"Blackmire Dirt","fr":"Terre de Blackmire","ty":"Terrain Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"A mix of soil, rock, and sediment.","o":"Creuse le sol du marais de Blackmire (nord-ouest des Bois envoûtés).","oe":""},{"n":"Revelwood Dirt","fr":"Terre de Revelwood","ty":"Terrain Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"A mix of soil, rock and sediment.","o":"Creuse le sol des Bois envoûtés.","oe":"Revelwoods Dirt can be found in the Revelwood."},{"n":"Springlands Dirt","fr":"Terre de Hautes pâtures","ty":"Terrain Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"A mix of soil, rock and sediment.","o":"Creuse le sol des Hautes pâtures.","oe":"Springlands Dirt can be found in the Springlands."},{"n":"Nomad Highlands Dirt","fr":"Terre des Plateaux nomades","ty":"Terrain Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"A mix of soil, rock and sediment.","o":"Creuse le sol des Plateaux nomades.","oe":"Nomad Highlands Dirt can be found in the Nomad Highlands."},{"n":"Veilwater Basin Dirt","fr":"Terre du Bassin des eaux voilées","ty":"Terrain Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"A mix of soil, rock and sediment.","o":"Creuse le sol du Bassin des eaux voilées.","oe":"Veilwater Basin Dirt can be found in Veilwater Basin."},{"n":"Flower Soil","fr":"Terre fleurie","ty":"Terrain Materials","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Springlands"],"d":"The perfect soil for growing beautiful flowers.","o":"Creuse les parcelles de sol couvertes de fleurs à Woodgard (Hautes pâtures).","oe":"Flower Soil can be found by digging patches of flower-covered ground at Woodgard."},{"n":"Chamomile Tea","fr":"Infusion de Camomille","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Revelwood"],"d":"A very healthy beverage that helps the body recover and prepare for the day to come.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Fabric","fr":"Tissu","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"A sturdy material that was woven out of linen. It revolutionized the clothing industry due to its flexibility and durability. It looks better as well.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Blue Fabric","fr":"Tissu bleu","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"Blue dyed fabric used for clothing.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Torn Cloth","fr":"Tissu déchiré","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"Torn and tattered remains of cloth that were left behind and now serve the Scavengers as clothing","o":"Butin courant des Déchus (humanoïdes corrompus) dans la Brume.","oe":""},{"n":"Yellow Fabric","fr":"Tissu jaune","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"Yellow dyed fabric used for clothing.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Orange Fabric","fr":"Tissu orange","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"Orange dyed fabric used for clothing.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Red Fabric","fr":"Tissu rouge","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"Red - the color of the Flame fitting for a Flameborn!","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Green Fabric","fr":"Tissu vert","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"The color of life - a wonderful color for clothes.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Violet Fabric","fr":"Tissu violet","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":33,"b":["Albaneve Summits"],"d":"A luscious, dyed fabric, usually reserved for creating the finest garments.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Tomato","fr":"Tomate","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Springlands"],"d":"A red and juicy Tomato! If handled with care, it can have Dexterity enhancing effects.","o":"Plants de tomates dans les Hautes pâtures (2 par plant), souvent dans les jardins des villages abandonnés. Se cultive avec des semis.","oe":"Tomato is obtained from Tomato plants, found in the Springlands biome.\nEach plant gives you x2 tomatoes.\nTomato plants can also be grown from Tomato Seedlings.\nAbandoned villages or houses that has a garden"},{"n":"Hydrak'Dal Head","fr":"Tête de Hydrak'Dal","ty":"Materials","ra":"Epic","lv":null,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"The head of a Drak'Dal tribe leader. You've severed it from its neck, but in its place, two new ones will form — figuratively speaking.","o":"Sur le boss Hydrak'Dal, dans le Bassin des eaux voilées. Nécessaire pour la Flamme niveau 9.","oe":"Hydrak'Dal Head is a drop from Hydrak'Dal, encountered in the Veilwater Basin."},{"n":"Fell Thunderbrute Head","fr":"Tête de Monstruosité des Déchus","ty":"Materials","ra":"Rare","lv":null,"b":["Springlands"],"d":"Its brain has been replaced by fungi and slush, but it's still tremendously heavy. The face is permanently petrified with a bitter expression.","o":"Sur la Brute du tonnerre des Déchus, dès la Brume des Hautes pâtures.","oe":"Fell Thunderbrute Head is a drop from Fell Thunderbrutes, first encountered in the Springlands Shroud."},{"n":"Cyclops Head","fr":"Tête de Cyclopes","ty":"Materials","ra":"Legendary","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"The severed head of a fearsome cyclops. It looks down on you with disdain.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Fell Cyclops Head","fr":"Tête de Cyclopes Déchu","ty":"Materials","ra":"Legendary","lv":null,"b":["Albaneve Summits"],"d":"The head of a Shroud infested Cyclops. It has pretty bad breath, even now.","o":"Sur le Cyclope des Déchus, dans un Puits de l'élixir des Sommets de l'Albaneve. Nécessaire pour la Flamme niveau 7.","oe":"Fell Cyclops Head is a drop from Fell Cyclops, encountered in an Elixir Well in the Albaneve Summits."},{"n":"Hollow Cyclops Head","fr":"Tête de Cyclopes Creux","ty":"Materials","ra":"Legendary","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"Its only eye still aimlessly rolled around in its socket before the beheading. Eventually, though, it spilled out.","o":"Sur les Cyclopes Creux (boss) des Salles creuses.","oe":""},{"n":"Fell Sicklescythe Head","fr":"Tête de Faucille des Déchus","ty":"Materials","ra":"Epic","lv":null,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"There's still a faint glow behind its eyes. Hopefully, they won't follow your every move.","o":"Sur le des Déchus Sicklescythe (Faucheur), dans la Brume des Regs exaltés (Temples du soleil hantés). Nécessaire pour la Flamme niveau 6.","oe":"Fell Sicklescythe Head is a drop from Fell Sicklescythes, encountered in the Kindlewastes Shroud."},{"n":"Fell Dragon Youngling Head","fr":"Tête de Jeune dragon Déchu","ty":"Materials","ra":"Legendary","lv":null,"b":["Albaneve Summits"],"d":"Its head alone weighs a monstrous amount. the shimmering scales are ice-cold.","o":"Sur le jeune Dragon des Déchus, au sommet du Pic hurlant (Sommets de l'Albaneve). Nécessaire pour la Flamme niveau 8.","oe":"Fell Dragon Youngling Head is a drop from Fell Dragon Younglings, encountered in the Albaneve Summits."},{"n":"Fell Monstrosity Head","fr":"Tête de monstruosité Déchu","ty":"Materials","ra":"Legendary","lv":null,"b":["Nomad Highlands"],"d":"Despair, hatred, loneliness... It grasps at anything to fill the void and leaves nothing but dust.","o":"Sur la Monstruosité des Déchus, dès la Brume des Plateaux nomades. Nécessaire pour la Flamme niveau 5.","oe":"Fell Monstrosity Head is a drop from Fell Monstrosities, first encountered in the Nomad Highlands Shroud."},{"n":"Vukah Brawler Head","fr":"Tête de Lutteur Vukah","ty":"Materials","ra":"Legendary","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"The tusks remain dangerous since they don't dull after death. Never stumble!","o":"Sur les Vukah bagarreurs, dès les Hautes pâtures.","oe":"Vukah Brawler Head is a drop from Vukah Brawlers, encountered starting in the Springlands."},{"n":"Fell Wispwyvern Head","fr":"Tête de Wispwyvern des Déchus","ty":"Materials","ra":"Legendary","lv":null,"b":["Revelwood"],"d":"When its luminous brood skipped over the waves near Pikemead's Reach, it was seen as a good omen. Unfortunately, no being, no matter how small, escapes the corrupting grasp of the Shroud.","o":"Sur la Wyverne des Déchus au Pic de Pikemead's Reach (Bois envoûtés). Nécessaire pour la Flamme niveau 4.","oe":"Fell Wispwyvern Head is a drop from the Fell Wispwyvern encountered at The Pike, Pikemead's Reach in the Revelwood."},{"n":"Shroud Vapor","fr":"Vapeur de Brume","ty":"Materials","ra":"Rare","lv":33,"b":[],"d":"A potent base for crafting potions of various kinds.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Glass","fr":"Verre","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"A wondrous material. It is transparent and offers many potential applications, especially in building and crafting!","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Raw Bird Meat","fr":"Viande d'oiseau crue","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"It's not properly cooked. Eating this raw would cause nausea.","o":"Sur les oiseaux (Queues-rouges, vautours…).","oe":""},{"n":"Raw Wolf Meat","fr":"Viande de Loup crue","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"Raw Wolf meat. Must be cooked for proper consumption.","o":"Sur les loups (Hautes pâtures).","oe":""},{"n":"Grilled Wolf Meat","fr":"Viande de Loup grillée","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Uncommon","lv":null,"b":["Springlands"],"d":"Roasted ribs were a delicacy back in the day, granting a good amount of Constitution to the consumer.","o":"Cuis de la viande de loup sur un feu de camp ou une station de cuisine.","oe":"Obtained from by manually cooking it at a fireplace, or by using a Cooking Station."},{"n":"Raw Dune Armadillo Meat","fr":"Viande de Tatou des dunes crue","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"Fleshy and tough. Better not eat it like this.","o":"Sur les Tatous des dunes (Regs exaltés).","oe":""},{"n":"Raw Fatty Meat","fr":"Viande crue et grasse","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"A tender, raw slab of fatty meat. It is uncooked, and therefore not consumable.","o":"Sur les animaux sauvages.","oe":""},{"n":"Raw Lean Meat","fr":"Viande maigre crue","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":[],"d":"Inedible, raw meat. Must be cooked over a campfire.","o":"Sur les animaux sauvages.","oe":""},{"n":"Old Books","fr":"Livres anciens","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"A stack of old parchments, worn and torn by the ravages of time. A wise man could salvage something from the remnants","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Underwater Overgrowth","fr":"Végétation sous-marine","ty":"Overgrowth Material","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":["Veilwater Basin"],"d":"Use the Overgrowth Tool to apply this to structures in your base.","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Scales","fr":"Peau d'animal","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"Hardened scales of wild animals. Some say they are as hard as stone.","o":"Lâchées par les Tatous des dunes et les Scorpions des Regs exaltés ; aussi produites par les tatous domestiqués.","oe":"Scales are dropped by Dune Armadillos and Scorpions in the Kindlewastes. They are also collected from domesticated Dune Armadillos."},{"n":"Giant Critter Scales","fr":"Écailles de bestiole géante","ty":"Materials","ra":"Uncommon","lv":13,"b":["Revelwood"],"d":"Massive, hardened scales. Lightweight yet incredibly tough, they are prime materials for crafting durable and flexible armor.","o":"Lâchées par la Reine des bestioles des Déchus, dès Bois envoûtés.","oe":"Dropped by Fell Critter Queen, first found in the Revelwood biome."},{"n":"Drak Scales","fr":"Écailles de Drak","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":40,"b":[],"d":"Fresh and glistening Drak scales, shimmering and shifting in the golden glow of the sun.","o":"Butin courant sur les Drak (Bassin des eaux voilées).","oe":"Drak Scales is also a common drop from Drak."},{"n":"Ectoplasm Shard","fr":"Éclat d'ectoplasme","ty":"Materials","ra":"Uncommon","lv":18,"b":["Nomad Highlands"],"d":"A good amount of crystallized ectoplasm. Inside slumbers the essence of vitality.","o":"Sur les ennemis Creux des Salles creuses, dès celles des Plateaux nomades.","oe":"Ectoplasm Shards can be obtained from defeating Hollow enemies in Hollow Halls, it first appears in the Nomad Highlands Hollow Halls."},{"n":"Glass Shards","fr":"Éclats de verre","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":["Kindlewastes"],"d":"Glass broken into pieces offers many sharp edges used to enhance weapons.","o":"Objets ramassables au sol dans les Regs exaltés.","oe":"Found as a physical item in the Kindlewastes."},{"n":"Fur Patch","fr":"Écusson de fourrure","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":5,"b":["Springlands"],"d":"A small shred of animal fur","o":"Butin courant des petits animaux (rats, chauves-souris), partout.","oe":"Fur Patch is a common drop from small wildlife such as Rats and Bats, found throughout Embervale."},{"n":"Corncob","fr":"Épi de maïs","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Springlands"],"d":"A very versatile crop that can be dried, grilled or consumed raw, strengthening the consumer for a short duration.","o":"Plants de maïs dans les Hautes pâtures (3 épis par plant). Se cultive avec des semis.","oe":"Corncob is obtained from Corn plants, found in the Springlands biome.\nEach Corn plant gives you x3 corncobs.\nCorncobs can also be grown from Corn Seedlings."},{"n":"Spice","fr":"Épice","ty":"Materials","ra":"Common","lv":25,"b":[],"d":"Nobody really knows what it is. They just call it the \"Spice\". It makes food much more delicious though, so it is highly sought after!","o":"","oe":""},{"n":"Spark","fr":"Étincelle","ty":"Tools","ra":"Legendary","lv":5,"b":[],"d":"A small amount of essence from the Flame! By feeding it back to the Flame Altar maybe it could become stronger and burn even brighter.","o":"Dans les Sanctuaires et Autels de la Flamme partout dans le monde : Hautes pâtures ×1, Bois envoûtés ×2, Plateaux nomades ×3, Regs exaltés ×4, Sommets de l'Albaneve ×5, Bassin des eaux voilées ×6. Indispensable pour monter le niveau de la Flamme.","oe":"Sparks can be collected from Flame Shrines and Flame Sanctums found throughout Embervale.\nThe amount of sparks gathered is decided by the biome the Flame Shrine and Sanctum reside.\n: Springlands x1\n: Revelwood x2\n: Nomad Highlands x3\n: Kindlewastes x4\n: Albaneve Summits x5\n: Veilwater Basin x6"},{"n":"Enshrouded Cyclops Eye","fr":"Œil de cyclope embrumé","ty":"Materials","ra":"Epic","lv":33,"b":["Albaneve Summits"],"d":"A massive, unblinking eye brimming with Shroud power. Its overwhelming energy is a critical element in crafting exotic high-level armor.","o":"Lâché par le Cyclope des Déchus, dès les Sommets de l'Albaneve.","oe":"Dropped by the Fell Cyclops, first found in the Albaneve Summits biome."},{"n":"Eggs","fr":"Œufs","ty":"Consumables","ra":"Common","lv":null,"b":["Nomad Highlands"],"d":"A great source of protein that enhances the muscle mass. Best consumed before a good exercise.","o":"Lâchés par plusieurs créatures (surtout les Queues-rouges aptères) dès les Plateaux nomades. Aussi produits par les Queues-rouges domestiquées.","oe":"Eggs are dropped by several creatures, primarily the Flightless Redtail, starting in the Nomad Highlands. They are also collected from domesticated Flightless Redtail."}];
